{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3470,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:exists-nonzero-normal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","line":5992,"source":"\\begin{proposition}\n\\label{prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-riemannian-metric, def:pseudo-metric-has-signature, def:induced-tensor-along-map, def:pseudo-normal-space, lem:exists-nonzero-normal, prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point, lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.70}\n\nLet $(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$ have signature $(r,s)$ and let $F$ present a codimension-one pseudo-Riemannian submanifold with induced $g$. If every nonzero normal is positive, then $g$ has signature $(r-1,s)$; if every nonzero normal is negative, then $g$ has signature $(r,s-1)$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature,lem:exists-nonzero-normal,prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point,lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\\sketch At each $p$, Lemma \\ref{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion} and Lemma \\ref{lem:exists-nonzero-normal} provide a nonzero normal. Proposition \\ref{prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point} gives $(r-1,s)$ in the positive case, including $r\\ge1$, and $(r,s-1)$ in the negative case, including $s\\ge1$. Definition \\ref{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature} makes the pointwise result global.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section> <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a70736575646f2d7269656d616e6e69616e2d6879706572737572666163652d7369676e6174757265\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-riemannian-metric\">↗ def:pseudo-riemannian-metric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-metric-has-signature\">↗ def:pseudo-metric-has-signature</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-tensor-along-map\">↗ def:induced-tensor-along-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-normal-space\">↗ def:pseudo-normal-space</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aexists-nonzero-normal\">↗ lem:exists-nonzero-normal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-signature-at-a-point\">↗ prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\">↗ lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.70</span></span><p></p>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$\">$(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$</span> have signature <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(r,s)$\">$(r,s)$</span> and let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F$\">$F$</span> present a codimension-one pseudo-Riemannian submanifold with induced <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span>. If every nonzero normal is positive, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> has signature <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(r-1,s)$\">$(r-1,s)$</span>; if every nonzero normal is negative, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> has signature <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(r,s-1)$\">$(r,s-1)$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-metric-has-signature\">↗ def:pseudo-metric-has-signature</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aexists-nonzero-normal\">↗ lem:exists-nonzero-normal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-signature-at-a-point\">↗ prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\">↗ lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion</a> \\sketch At each <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span>, Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-submanifold-immersion\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a70736575646f2d7375626d616e69666f6c642d696d6d657273696f6e\">17</a> and Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aexists-nonzero-normal\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:exists-nonzero-normal\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6578697374732d6e6f6e7a65726f2d6e6f726d616c\">17</a> provide a nonzero normal. Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-signature-at-a-point\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d7369676e61747572652d61742d612d706f696e74\">17</a> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(r-1,s)$\">$(r-1,s)$</span> in the positive case, including <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r\\ge 1$\">$r\\ge 1$</span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(r,s-1)$\">$(r,s-1)$</span> in the negative case, including <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s\\ge 1$\">$s\\ge 1$</span>. Definition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Apseudo-metric-has-signature\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a70736575646f2d6d65747269632d6861732d7369676e6174757265\">3</a> makes the pointwise result global. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-hypersurface-induced-tensor-nondegenerate","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","title":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","label":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","title":"def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","label":"def:pseudo-metric-has-signature"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","label":"def:induced-tensor-along-map"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space","title":"def:pseudo-normal-space","label":"def:pseudo-normal-space"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:exists-nonzero-normal","title":"lem:exists-nonzero-normal","label":"lem:exists-nonzero-normal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","title":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","label":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","label":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#cor:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-submanifold","title":"cor:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-submanifold","label":"cor:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-submanifold"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature","tex":"\\begin{proposition}\n\\label{prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-signature}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-riemannian-metric, def:pseudo-metric-has-signature, def:induced-tensor-along-map, def:pseudo-normal-space, lem:exists-nonzero-normal, prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point, lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\n\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.70}\n\nLet $(\\widetilde M,\\widetilde g)$ have signature $(r,s)$ and let $F$ present a codimension-one pseudo-Riemannian submanifold with induced $g$. If every nonzero normal is positive, then $g$ has signature $(r-1,s)$; if every nonzero normal is negative, then $g$ has signature $(r,s-1)$.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature,lem:exists-nonzero-normal,prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point,lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion}\n\\sketch At each $p$, Lemma \\ref{lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion} and Lemma \\ref{lem:exists-nonzero-normal} provide a nonzero normal. Proposition \\ref{prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point} gives $(r-1,s)$ in the positive case, including $r\\ge1$, and $(r,s-1)$ in the negative case, including $s\\ge1$. Definition \\ref{def:pseudo-metric-has-signature} makes the pointwise result global.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","title":"def:pseudo-riemannian-metric","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","title":"def:pseudo-metric-has-signature","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-tensor-along-map","title":"def:induced-tensor-along-map","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-normal-space","title":"def:pseudo-normal-space","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:exists-nonzero-normal","title":"lem:exists-nonzero-normal","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","title":"prop:hypersurface-signature-at-a-point","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","title":"lem:pseudo-submanifold-immersion","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}